cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this script or its generated datasets, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "jupiterweb-bot: Extrator de dados de disciplinas optativas do JupiterWeb USP"
abstract: >-
  A JavaScript automation script designed to extract course data from the USP JupiterWeb 
  enrollment system. Executed directly in the browser console, it compiles details such 
  as schedules, credits, professors, and available vacancies for elective courses into 
  a structured CSV dataset.
authors:
